{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"T4 空间"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"T4空间"},0],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"拓扑学","text":"拓扑学"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>$T_4$ 空间是满足如下条件的拓扑空间 $X$:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>任意两个不相交的闭集 $V, V'$ 都被两个不相交的开邻域 $U,U'$ 分离.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>称 $T_4$ 且 "},{"Local":{"url":"T1空间","text":"$T_1$"}},{"Plain":" 的空间为<strong>正规空间</strong> (normal space).</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"分离性(拓扑学)","text":"分离性"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}